      <div class="akl reveal"><span class="akl-i" aria-hidden="true"><svg class="i fill"><use href="#i-lock"/></svg></span><div><h3>Who sees my records?</h3><p class="ans">Only the people you choose to share them with. You can write a record about someone and keep it to yourself: it stays private until you send it, and you never have to.</p></div></div>
